:: Shop Bailey Gift
<<effects>>

You walk through the shops, thinking of what Bailey might actually want for Christmas. You know better than to guess wrong.
<br><br>

<<if $money gte 5000>>
	<<gifticon "christmas">><<link [[Winter reserve vodka (£50)|Shop Bailey Christmas]]>><<pass 10>><<money -5000>><<set $christmasGiftBailey to "vodka_unwrapped">><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You could buy a bottle of winter reserve vodka here, <span class="blue">if you had more money (£50).</span>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $money gte 25000>>
	<<gifticon "christmas">><<link [[Snake-shaped fishing lure (£250)|Shop Bailey Christmas]]>><<pass 10>><<money -25000>><<set $christmasGiftBailey to "lure_unwrapped">><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You could buy a snake-shaped fishing lure here, <span class="blue">if you had more money (£250).</span>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $money gte 50000>>
	<<gifticon "christmas">><<link [[Ebony-and-ivory chessboard (£500)|Shop Bailey Christmas]]>><<pass 10>><<money -50000>><<set $christmasGiftBailey to "chessboard_unwrapped">><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You could buy an ebony-and-ivory chessboard here, <span class="blue">if you had more money (£500).</span>
	<br>
<</if>>
<br>
<<if $christmasBaileyLotusDay gte 0>>
	<span class="blue"><i>You've already given Bailey something that can't be replaced.</i></span>
	<br>
<<elseif $christmasGiftBailey is "lotus_unwrapped" or $christmasGiftBailey is "lotus">>
	<span class="blue"><i>You could buy Bailey a different gift, or finish your floral arrangement in your room.</i></span>
	<br>
<<elseif $plants_known and $plants_known.includes("lotus") and (($foodstuff and $foodstuff["lotus"] and $foodstuff["lotus"].amount gte 1) or ($plants and $plants["lotus"] and $plants["lotus"].amount gte 1))>>
	<<if $money gte 5000>>
		<<gifticon "christmas">><<link [[Find supplies to arrange with your lotus flower (£50)|Shop Bailey Lotus]]>><<pass 10>><<money -5000>><<set $christmasGiftBailey to "lotus_unwrapped">><<if $foodstuff and $foodstuff["lotus"]>><<set $foodstuff["lotus"].amount -= 1>><<elseif $plants and $plants["lotus"]>><<set $plants["lotus"].amount -= 1>><</if>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		You could buy floral arrangement supplies here, <span class="blue">if you had more money (£50).</span>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<span class="blue"><i>Maybe you could grow something for Bailey...</i></span>
	<br>
<</if>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Shopping Centre]]>><<endevent phaseless>><</link>>
<br>

:: Shop Bailey Christmas
<<effects>>

You make your purchase. <<if $christmas_wrap is undefined>>Now you just need wrapping paper.<<else>>You can wrap it in your room.<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Shopping Centre]]>><<endevent phaseless>><</link>>

:: Shop Bailey Lotus
<<effects>>

You find a slender vase, a spool of ribbon, and some filler flowers to complement your lotus flower. Everything you need for a floral arrangement. <<if $christmas_wrap is undefined>>Now you just need wrapping paper.<<else>>You can wrap it in your room.<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Shopping Centre]]>><<endevent phaseless>><</link>>

:: Bedroom Bailey Wrap
<<effects>><<wearProp "giftbox">>


<<if $christmasGiftBailey is "lotus_unwrapped" or $christmasGiftBailey is "lotus">>
	<<pass 20>>
	<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
		You spend a long time arranging and rearranging the lotus flower. You worry about how Bailey will react. You tie the ribbon three times before it looks the way you want it to. You write Bailey's name carefully on the front before you place it under the tree.
	<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
		You work quickly while arranging the lotus flower. The arrangement ends up better than you expected. You tie the ribbon once, tight. You write Bailey's name on the front. You put it under the tree before you can think about it too hard.
	<<else>>
		You take your time arranging the lotus flower. There's something satisfying about getting it right. You set the stems at the right height and tie it together with a ribbon. You write Bailey's name on the front and place it under the tree.
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	You wrap Bailey's gift as neatly as you can manage. Bailey's name is written on the front in your handwriting. You place it under the plastic tree in the main hall.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Bedroom]]>><<endevent phaseless>><</link>>
<br>
